{"id":27556,"author":"Czco","body":"\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIGN: Czco \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;OLD IGN COCO_STAG\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eDiscord(ex. Name#1234): Coco_stag#4527\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eTimezone: GMT\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eWhy would you like to join the referee team(brief paragraph): I would like to\u0026nbsp;start in the\u0026nbsp;amicus rankings and i\u0026nbsp;believe here is a good place to start. I would love to help out with tourneys and hopefully give some suggestions to make them better. I feel that i have been in some tourney games were the refs have not helped me and my team so i would like to be a ref that is\u0026nbsp;prepared and\u0026nbsp;ready to help any team or people.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eBest time of the week?: Umm well i mean\u0026nbsp;I'm on everyday for\u0026nbsp;atlas 5-6 hours, and basically all day weekends,\u0026nbsp;is\u0026nbsp;I'm very active.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eA paragraph or two to tell us something about yourself(Pretend you are trying to sell yourself to us): i am a person, a person willing to do anything that will\u0026nbsp;enhance my\u0026nbsp;future. i am\u0026nbsp;consistence at my work and a person always willing to help others as long as its in a\u0026nbsp;considerably sensible\u0026nbsp;boundaries. I am determined and\u0026nbsp;prices with everything and i like to sweat at\u0026nbsp;Minecraft. \u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eAnything else?: A wile back just after conquest inc PieZ told me if i wanted to start to help the community and be in a position to do that i should\u0026nbsp;apply\u0026nbsp;for ref when the apps are next open so here i am.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei Hope you enjoy reading and would like to accept my app\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrom:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eCoco (coco_stag)\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIGN: Czco \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;OLD IGN COCO_STAG\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eDiscord(ex. Name#1234): Coco_stag#4527\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eTimezone: GMT\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eWhy would you like to join the referee team(brief paragraph): I would like to\u0026nbsp;start in the\u0026nbsp;amicus rankings and i\u0026nbsp;believe here is a good place to start. I would love to help out with tourneys and hopefully give some suggestions to make them better. I feel that i have been in some tourney games were the refs have not helped me and my team so i would like to be a ref that is\u0026nbsp;prepared and\u0026nbsp;ready to help any team or people.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont co